data requirements that we had.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:01.580
We particularly liked the
ability to use predictable VMs,

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:05.090
or preemptible VMs, which
have predictable pricing.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.895
Versus things like
spot markets on AWS,

00:08:06.895 --> 00:08:09.020
where the market fluctuations
were difficult for us

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.760
to manage.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.060
The pricing model felt
very natural for how where

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:16.162
