00:26:43.020 --> 00:26:44.900
And so this is just
kind of a good graph

00:26:44.900 --> 00:26:47.375
to remind us where we've been
and what we've been up to,

00:26:47.375 --> 00:26:50.000
and sort of the scale that we've
